WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.631
Trace a state update.

00:00:01.631 --> 00:00:07.747
When the learner selects a lesson, React renders the interface from the selected lesson ID.

00:00:07.747 --> 00:00:10.601
Keep a single owner for shared state.

00:00:10.601 --> 00:00:13.455
The sidebar sends the selected lesson ID.

00:00:13.455 --> 00:00:16.309
The player stores that ID with useState.

00:00:16.309 --> 00:00:19.571
The stage derives its content from the ID.

00:00:20.083 --> 00:00:21.906
Derive a filtered list.

00:00:21.906 --> 00:00:28.284
Use the course list and the active filter to calculate visible courses during render.

00:00:28.284 --> 00:00:31.929
A derived value stays aligned with its inputs.

00:00:31.929 --> 00:00:34.662
Keep the complete course list available.

00:00:34.662 --> 00:00:37.396
Store the selected category in state.

00:00:37.396 --> 00:00:40.129
Filter courses by the selected category.

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:42.304
Use stable list keys.

00:00:42.304 --> 00:00:50.084
A stable key lets React match a row to the same course when a list is sorted or filtered.

00:00:50.084 --> 00:00:52.950
A permanent course ID provides that identity.

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:55.816
Assign one persistent ID to each course.

00:00:55.816 --> 00:00:58.272
Sort courses without changing those IDs.

00:00:58.272 --> 00:01:01.548
React matches each row by its course ID.

